        Cross-tenant signature mismatch -> 401.

    Both share the PostgresFixture / TenantHarness shape from
    Outbound/Inventory integration tests. Sprint-4 ships the project skel
    + the scale-gate skeleton; the harness body is deferred to a
    follow-up (sign-off documents).
